      "writtenOn": "2025-10-28T00:48:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this a big hinderance, or just a minor inconvenience?\n\nI see the code in this file only calls getInfo(), startIncrementalDecode(), and incrementalDecode(). It\u0027s hard to see beyond that as to whether getFrameCount() or anything else that should be avoided is being called transitively.",
