        "id": 7232
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-28T18:37:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let me add a clarification to the comment that:\n\n```\n/// ...  This is not an issue today, because\n// PDFium only needs to decode the first (or only) image / animation frame.\n```\n\nI mostly intended this comment to be a warning for future developers, because calling `getFrameCount` will compile fine, but may cause runtime decoding failures later (e.g. if during `getFrameCount` we try to parse metadata of all animation frames, but then have to rewind/seek-back to try to decode the first frame).\n\nDone?",
      "parentUuid": "378ab09c_6fd6f707",
