        "id": 7232
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-28T18:37:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wondered about that, but it seems less robust - it is not documented whether `CFX_DIBitmap::GetWritableScanline` returns a span that covers a potential end-of-the-row padding or not.\n\nI guess it is also not documented whether `GetWritableBuffer` includes padding at the very end of the image, but it seems more natural (we return the whole buffer - the whole buffer should include the padding I think).",
